@nexlineai/dsh-tui README · dsh-tui：**`dsh-tui`** runs the official DeepSeek Harness *agent* (tools, file editing, shell, subagents, sessions, permissions, plan mode) behind a Claude Code / opencode-style interface — live token streaming, reasoning blocks, boxed tool cards, prompt history, and a full slash-command suite. No browser, no Electron, just your terminal.

It is **not** a model wrapper or a plain chat REPL — it drives the real agent runtime.

---

@nexlineai/dsh-tui README · 3. Run it：dsh --profile tui
```

The profile initializes on first use; `dsh-tui` composes over the same `@deepseek-ai/dsh-base` core as the web UI.

